Subject: [PATCH 13/38] samples: rust: add read-only file system sample

A four-entry in-memory file system exercising registration, lookup,
readdir, read_folio and get_link. Adapted from the RFC's rust_rofs.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SKmspe5nVbuvzdvYZa9UhW
